    "findingsResolved": [
      "Paused OFF client state could allow unbound raw copy; further root review found stale cross-window OFF and boot old-status authority. Both paths now fail closed or copy safe summary.",
      "Copy options initially added rows to code/tool content. Minimal production CSS keeps compact keyboard-accessible menus outside scrollable pre content without adding text rows.",
      "Plaintext fixture reused a DOM id and had weak per-slot receiver checks. Final checks target each current slot and compare complete expected content.",
      "A proposed 00e source owner added 22 cycle edges. Moving the unchanged logger and helpers to original 04 restores the original 88 modules/631 edges/67 forward edges/one SCC.",
      "Component fixture omitted production post-mount near-view highlighting. The public lifecycle call now matches session-experience, without fabricated buttons or internal highlighter calls."
    ],
